# Accepted vulnerabilities, with reasoning and an expiry date.
#
# An entry here is a decision, not a silencing. Each one states why the finding
# does not apply to this application and when it must be reviewed again. A
# .trivyignore with bare CVE ids and no justification is indistinguishable from
# someone hiding a real problem.
#
# Both entries below need starlette 1.x. FastAPI 0.142.2 requires
# starlette <1.0, so adopting the fix means waiting for FastAPI to support it.
# Neither affects this application.

# SSRF and NTLM credential theft via UNC paths in StaticFiles, on Windows.
# This application does not use StaticFiles - the frontend is served by nginx
# in a separate container - and runs only in Linux containers.
CVE-2026-48818 exp:2026-12-31

# request.form() size limits silently ignored for x-www-form-urlencoded bodies.
# Every endpoint here accepts JSON only; there is no form parsing anywhere in
# the application. Request size is bounded at the ingress regardless.
CVE-2026-54283 exp:2026-12-31
